                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you search for dry van trailer dimensions, you're probably not looking for a generic chart. You want to know what those numbers actually mean for your loads, your contracts, and your profit.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we talk to owner-operators and fleet managers every day who are weighing decisions carefully. You're not buying a trailer for fun. You're buying it to protect your margins, serve your customers, and keep your operation running smoothly.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-standard-dims",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding Standard Dry Van Trailer Dimensions",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "standard-dims"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-standard-dims-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The most common configuration on the road today is the 53-foot trailer. When people reference 53' dry van dimensions or 53ft dry van dimensions, they typically mean:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-standard-dims-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "53 feet"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "102 inches (8.5 feet)"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "About 100 inches"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Around 110 inches"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Approximately 13.5 feet"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-standard-dims-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These dry van dimensions allow you to haul up to 26 standard 48×40 pallets, depending on how they're loaded. But here's what matters more than the numbers: what those dimensions allow you to do.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-standard-dims-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
