                        ],
                        "outro": "The dimensions may be the same, but condition and build quality will influence longevity and performance."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At the end of the day, understanding dry van trailer dimensions is only part of the equation. The dealership experience matters just as much. At Sun State Trailers, we believe in straightforward communication, professional service, dependable inventory, and long-term relationships. We know your business depends on equipment that works as hard as you do. That's why we stand behind every trailer we sell or rent.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "why-sunstate"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-grow-smart-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The right dry van trailer dimensions should align with your freight profile, maximize revenue per load, support efficient loading and unloading, and protect your long-term trailer ROI. Whether you're expanding your fleet or replacing aging equipment, choosing the right trailer size is a business decision that deserves careful consideration. If you're ready to review dependable options built for real-world hauling, <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">our team</a> is here to help.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
